<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vople puts buy on Nastech.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vople puts buy on Nastech.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Volpe Welty said it initiated coverage of Nastech Pharmaceuticals Co with a buy rating, putting a 12-month price target of $25 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The shares rose 3/8 at 13-1/2.</p>
</text>
